        <a class="goto" href="https://opencode.ai/go?ref=Z4S0MDY3TX" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">官方订阅 →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="top3-card">
        <div class="rank num">No. 3</div>
        <div class="name">阶跃星辰 Step Plan Flash Plus</div>
        <div class="price num">¥99/月</div>
        <p>Step 5 Preview 44 分追平 Kimi K3，1600M Credits 月池，<b>无 5 小时限额</b>。走量场景不用担心被掐断，新用户还有最长 75 天福利。</p>
        <a class="goto" href="https://platform.stepfun.com/docs/zh/step-plan/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener">官方订阅 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-bottom:3rem">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>开源</p>
